Shake-to-find: enlarge the cursor while the pointer is shaken.

Local niri patch. Detection follows KWin's shake cursor effect. The normal
cursor path is unchanged; only an enlarged named cursor is rendered differently.
Config: `cursor { shake-to-find; shake-to-find-scale 3; }`.

